{
  "rationale": "The plant G1 models the robot's combined perception and actuation interface, capturing all possible sensor outcomes and motion commands. The specification E1 encodes the safe exploration policy: move forward or random_walk in clear, recover with a single backward pulse on front obstacle, turn away from side obstacles, and return to exploration as soon as path_clear is observed. All obstacle events force a recovery state before exploration resumes. Only one controllable is enabled per state, and move_backward is used only as a one-shot escape from front obstacles.",
  "strategy": [
    "Model all perception and actuation as a single plant automaton for determinism and clarity.",
